WEBVTT

00:00:00.005 --> 00:00:02.397
Account →
App & notifications.

00:00:02.397 --> 00:00:04.905
On Android, open
Club Batting in Chrome.

00:00:04.905 --> 00:00:08.898
Chrome: ⋮ →
Install and create shortcut.

00:00:08.898 --> 00:00:13.517
Choose Install.
Follow the phone’s prompts.

00:00:13.517 --> 00:00:17.871
Open the new app icon.
Sign in if asked.

00:00:17.871 --> 00:00:20.464
Return to Account →
App & notifications.

00:00:20.464 --> 00:00:26.815
Keep Club messages
and Coaching updates ticked.

00:00:26.815 --> 00:00:28.821
Tap Enable notifications.

00:00:28.821 --> 00:00:32.709
Choose Allow when
your phone asks.

00:00:32.709 --> 00:00:37.261
Check for
Notifications on ✓.

00:00:37.261 --> 00:00:42.065
Until alerts are enabled,
you’ll keep getting emails.
